  "description": "<p><strong>Campaign overview:</strong> ReptiChip Premium Coconut Substrate is the highest quality animal bedding available for reptiles and amphibians...and we'd like to get the word out!</p>\r\n<p><strong>Campaign goals:</strong> Brand exposure, sales conversion.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Key talking points:</strong> ReptiChip reptile substrates are made of 100% safe, renewable, organic coconut husk, and have been meticulously cleaned and sorted to provide for the unique requirements of our reptile and amphibian pets.</p>\r\n<p><strong>About Us: </strong>Our products are made by reptile people, for reptile people; we purposely choose to partner with individuals and companies in the reptile community who understand that we put our animals needs before all else. With a collection of over three hundred reptiles here at ReptiChip, our only business is reptile bedding and supplies.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>About Our Products: </strong>Products are available in either compressed blocks, or bags that are ready to use. The compressed blocks require the customer to add water to expand. Many customers like to create custom mixes with our products to create the perfect substrate for their individual animals. For example: some customers like to start with a base of ReptiEarth, and mix in BabiChip small sized chips to allow the mix to retain more water for humidity. As a top layer for their terrarium, many keepers like to use MicroChip that looks good and mimics a natural forest or jungle floor, and some keepers use RediChip as a drainage layer for their planted/naturalistic terrarium.&nbsp;</p>",
